  "description": "A simple component to mock command line interface(CLI) for ASP.NET Core Blazor applications to execute some custom commands for an application. \n    Within ICommand interface it is possible to implement any custom business related commands for Blazor.Console\n    \n   Example scenarios;\n    - Clear response cache\n    - Export log files\n    - Change run-time settings\n    - Monitor application resources\n   \n   Updates:\n    - .NET 10.0 upgrade\n    - Some refactoring and improvements",
